WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.858
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: Write an Email in One Minute.

2
00:00:06.158 --> 00:00:11.597
Use AI to draft a clear and polite email. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:12.583 --> 00:00:20.997
Step one. Tell the AI who the email is for, why you write, and the tone. For example, a polite email to my teacher about homework.

4
00:00:21.983 --> 00:00:25.799
Step two. Read the draft. Does it say what you want?

5
00:00:26.783 --> 00:00:33.316
Step three. Ask the AI to change the tone. For example, make it shorter and friendlier.

6
00:00:34.317 --> 00:00:41.291
Step four. Check names, dates and facts. Then copy the email into your mail app and send it yourself.

7
00:00:42.283 --> 00:00:45.992
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:46.292 --> 00:00:50.091
Ask AI to write an email to your boss or teacher.

9
00:00:50.391 --> 00:00:52.519
Change the tone to more formal.

10
00:00:52.819 --> 00:00:54.830
Check the facts before you send.

11
00:00:55.130 --> 00:00:56.084
Well done!

